cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Piperic Open Datasets: Top 1 Million Websites & AI Crawler Registry"
message: "If you use these datasets, please cite them using the metadata from this file."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Rácz-Akácosi"
    given-names: "Attila"
    affiliation: "Piperic Business Intelligence"
repository-code: "https://github.com/piperic/piperic-datasets"
url: "https://piperic.com"
abstract: >-
  Two openly licensed datasets derived from an independent index of 50M+ live,
  content-validated websites: (1) the top 1,000,000 websites ranked by the
  number of distinct domains linking to them from their homepages, and (2) a
  registry of 969 AI crawlers and AI-adjacent bots with operator, purpose,
  robots.txt compliance and user-agent patterns.
keywords:
  - web measurement
  - website popularity
  - link graph
  - AI crawlers
  - robots.txt
  - web crawling
license: CC-BY-4.0
